          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAC+HelveticaNeue-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Trust is important to Maggy Morford."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          68.03046654040406,
          325.26112128267977,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Known all over Abilene for her devotion to good"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          84.85448263888895,
          325.3530530637255,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "causes, Morford is one of the community’s most"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          101.67843402777783,
          325.27622830882353,
          13.534659090909145
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "benevolent trustees – a generous contributor of"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          118.50245012626272,
          325.00036597222226,
          13.534672032828212
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "money, time and hard work. Her style of leadership"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          135.3263885732324,
          325.2701151552288,
          13.534672032828212
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "is to be active, get things done and set a positive"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          152.15041761363636,
          204.5914889297386,
          13.534659090909145
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "example for the city she loves."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          173.63349873737377,
          325.14800281862745,
          13.534659090909031
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Morford does business with First National Bank of"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          190.45861489898994,
          325.65455714869285,
          13.534672032828212
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Abilene, in part because she appreciates the"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          207.2837440025254,
          324.9099750408497,
          13.534672032828212
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "example they set, too. “My husband was in the cat-"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          224.10887310606074,
          325.2761780637255,
          13.534672032828212
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "tle business. He depended upon loans from First"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          240.93400220959597,
          325.0787315767974,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "National,” says Morford. “After he died, I knew that"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          257.7591313131313,
          3.9555285947712377,
          13.534659090909145
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "I"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          80.55032843137255,
          257.7591313131313,
          317.1141147875817,
          13.534659090909145
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "did not want to stay in the cattle business, so I"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          274.584338068182,
          262.41659595588237,
          13.534659090909031
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "sold it. That gave me money to invest.”"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          296.06741919191927,
          325.15409922385624,
          13.534659090909031
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Morford chose to work with First National Bank of"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          312.89135763888896,
          325.348547753268,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Abilene’s Trust Department. “I created a family"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          329.71529608585865,
          325.1857536356209,
          13.534672032828212
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "limited partnership. During a time when there was"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          346.53931218434343,
          325.35002160947715,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "a lot of hysteria in the markets, they were con-"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          363.36330239898996,
          325.2761445669935,
          13.534672032828212
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "servative. They kept an even keel and have done"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          380.1872796717172,
          213.5270939133987,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "well despite the difficult market."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          401.67032196969706,
          325.3078659722222,
          13.534672032828212
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "“They are a good bunch of folks, and they make"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          418.4942992424243,
          325.066672753268,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "it a point to serve the community by joining boards"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          435.3182894570707,
          325.03505183823535,
          13.534659090909145
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "and lending a hand where help is needed. They are"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          452.14226672979805,
          325.2565992238562,
          13.534672032828212
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "very careful in the people they hire. They nurture"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          468.9662440025253,
          325.3214154003268,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "them and bring them along, and they don’t hesi-"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          485.7902342171718,
          325.35005510620914,
          13.534659090909031
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "tate to recruit from other areas when necessary."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          502.61421148989905,
          325.29125159313725,
          13.534672032828269
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "They keep the interests of the shareholders and"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          519.4381499368687,
          171.1071841911765,
          13.534672032828269
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "customers close to heart."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          540.921231060606,
          325.29275894607844,
          13.534672032828269
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "“With First Financial Bankshares, you know the"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          557.7452212752526,
          325.3349480800654,
          13.534659090909088
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "people that you work with, and they are friends."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          72.34909072712419,
          574.5691985479798,
          151.0171674428105,
          13.534672032828269
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            41,
            59,
            31,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "People that you trust.”"
      }
    ],
    [],
    [
